[3] FIELD-SCOPE NOTE for query B (Arabic prefix)
    native or-filters (account_name, name) match 0 row(s); governed (bilingual+norm) match 1 row(s)
    -> the ADR comparative ratio is NOT comparable for Arabic query text: the two legs search
